{"product_id":"black-powder","title":"Black Powder","description":"\u003cp\u003eEngland, 1605. 12-year-old Tom must save his father from hanging. He falls in with a mysterious stranger - the Falcon - who promises to help him in exchange for his service. But on the long journey to London, Tom discovers the Falcon's true mission - and a plot to blow up Parliament with barrels of black powder. Tom faces a terrible decision: secure his father's release, or stop the assassination of the king.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ally Sherrick\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781910655269\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803730141337,"sku":"15RB-3-9781910655269","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f36340ee6fd_Black_Powder_Ally_Sherrick.jpg?v=1760808198","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/black-powder","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}